Description: python-abraflexi English HTML documentation
 Sphinx-generated English HTML documentation for python-abraflexi, a Python
 client library for the AbraFlexi (FlexiBee) REST API.
 .
 An Apache2 configuration snippet is enabled automatically on installation.
 An Nginx configuration snippet is installed to
 /usr/share/doc/python3-abraflexi-doc-en/.
